sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OP as Floor Operator
    participant STAND as Fabric Roller
    participant ENC as Rotary Encoder
    participant CAM as Industrial Camera
    participant MON as Edge Inspection Monitor
    participant AI as AI Vision & Tracking Engine
    participant DB as Local SQLite Storage
    participant CLOUD as Central Backend API
    actor QI as Quality Inspector (Web/Mobile)

    OP->>DB: Initiate Inspection Session (Scan Roll QR)
    DB-->>OP: Session Confirmed (Roll ID, Fabric Type)
    
    STAND->>ENC: Fabric Web Moves (Linear Displacement)
    ENC->>MON: Stream Channel A/B Pulses (Distance Increment ΔL)
    STAND->>CAM: Fabric Reflects Regulated Light
    CAM->>MON: Deliver Video Frame Stream (Timestamped)

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over MON: Step 1: Real-Time Reliability Gate Validation
        MON->>MON: Check Camera Signal, Illumination Uniformity, Blur & Frame Sync
    end

    alt Reliability Check Passed (Optimal Conditions)
        MON->>AI: Dispatch Frame + Current Rotary Pulse Counter
        AI->>AI: Preprocess Image (CLAHE Contrast + ROI Extraction)
        AI->>AI: Execute AI Defect Detection (YOLO Inference)
        AI->>AI: Track Defect Across Frames (Kalman Filter + IoU Matching)
        AI->>AI: Spatial-Temporal Deduplication (Suppress duplicate counts)
        AI->>AI: Calculate Metric Position (X_cm from pixel calibration, Y_m from encoder)
        AI->>DB: Write Defect Record {TrackID, Class, BBox, X_cm, Y_m, ImageFile}
        DB-->>AI: Record Persisted (Status: Queued for Sync)
        
        opt Defect Discovered Above Severity Threshold
            AI->>OP: Dispatch Real-Time Mobile Vibration & Screen Alert
            AI->>CLOUD: Stream Live Defect Telemetry (If Online)
            CLOUD->>QI: Update Digital Defect Map in Real-Time
        end

    else Reliability Check Failed (e.g. Frame Drop / Cam Disconnect / Lighting Drop)
        MON->>MON: Calculate Affected Interval [L_start = Y, L_end = Y + ΔL]
        MON->>DB: Record Uninspected Section Span (Reason, Severity, Coordinates)
        Note over DB: CRITICAL: Explicitly flagged as 'UNINSPECTED'<br/>NEVER recorded as defect-free!
        MON->>OP: Trigger Local Warning Beacon & Push Alert ("Inspection Compromised")
        MON->>CLOUD: Broadcast Reliability Warning Event
        CLOUD->>QI: Render Yellow/Hashed 'Uninspected' Segment on Roll Map
    end

    opt Quality Inspector Review
        QI->>CLOUD: Review Detected Defect Bounding Box & Class Label
        QI->>CLOUD: Submit Correction / Verification (Update Defect Class)
        CLOUD->>DB: Re-sync Corrected Verification State
    end

